sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProjectEditorPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>CreateProjectBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>CreateProjectController
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: create an IDP
  UI->>B: POST /api/designer/projects (JWT)
  B->>C: create(Integer designerId, ProjectRequest request)
  alt inactive category / invalid dates
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Category: findById()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: save()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C-->>B: DesignerProjectDetail
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end